<title>JAPAN: Benesse plans share split.</title>
<headline>Benesse plans share split.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Benesse Corp said on Friday it planned a 1.2-for-1 share split on May 20, for shareholders as of March 31.</p>
</text>
